	chapter_group.718FD040212D6C62.title: "Introduction"
	quest.05385743C91B10EF.quest_desc: ["You don't &oneed&r a &lDepot&r but it does make some Mechanical Press recipes a little easier."]
	quest.05385743C91B10EF.quest_subtitle: "Not necessary, but helpful."
	quest.0D0E239059813776.quest_desc: [
		"Different mobs can be attached to the &bHorse Crank&r with a lead. How well they perform is up to you."
		""
		"Grass/ Dirt blocks in a &4&l7x7&r&r from center beneath the &bHorse Crank&r is &4&l&nREQUIRED!!!&r&r&r"
		""
		"Small Creatures Produce: &6128 Su&r"
		""
		"- Pig"
		"- Sheep"
		""
		"Medium Creatures Produce: &6256 Su&r"
		""
		"- Cow"
		"- Goat"
		"- llama"
		""
		"Large Creatures Produce: &6512 Su&r"
		""
		"- Horse"
		"- Camel"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Some blocks can increase the RPM output of your horse crank when placed in a &47x7&r beneath the &bHorse Crank&r from the center."
		""
		"Paths:"
		""
		"- &4Poor:&r dirt, grass block"
		"  &60.5x rpm multiplier&r"
		""
		"- &eNormal:&r dirt path, gravel"
		"  &61x rpm multiplier&r"
		""
		"- &aGreat:&r vanilla bricks, ice"
		"  &62x rpm multiplier&r"
	]
	quest.0D0E239059813776.quest_subtitle: "Quit horsing around!"
	quest.109938A7176DF606.quest_desc: ["Make sure to collect a few &6Blaze Rods&r, you'll need them for later. Also, if you've started to dive further into Create take a look at the &l&nBlaze Burner&r&r quest."]
	quest.15B8A416EE240939.title: "Book Shelves"
	quest.16475B0D00F1DF13.quest_desc: ["Use 3 rocks and 2 sticks to get yourself a Stone Pickaxe. Don't get too excited, you can't even collect cobblestone with it."]
	quest.16475B0D00F1DF13.title: "Baby's First Pick"
	quest.16C7DD2BA3F67A5E.quest_subtitle: "C A M P F I R E S O N G SONG!"
	quest.1AF4119006BBD07B.quest_desc: [
		"In order to get your first set of Iron tools you will need the &lMechanical Press&r and a &lBasin&r, this is how you will get your tool heads."
		""
		"We recommend using the hand crank only for tool creation, as automating it can get funky without recipe filters which you likely don't have yet."
	]
	quest.21EA72337097ADBF.quest_desc: ["{image:entity:minecraft:wither width:96 height:96 align:center}"]
	quest.21EA72337097ADBF.quest_subtitle: "Are you ready?"
	quest.2647B21344C5A841.quest_desc: [
		"To process &9Lapis&r youll need to right click &9Rough Lazurite&r on a &7Grindstone&r!"
		""
		"However if you want to process &bDiamonds&r and &aEmeralds&r you'll need to craft the &bDiamond Grindstone&r!"
		""
		"Right clicking &aRough Emerald&r and &bRough Diamond&r onto the &bDiamond Grindstone&r will give you &bDiamonds&r and &aEmeralds&r!"
		""
		"The &bDiamond Grindstone&r depletes by 3 stages, once it hits depleted 3 you will need to shift right click"
		"&bDiamond Shards&r onto the &bDiamond Grindstone&r to repair it."
	]
	quest.2647B21344C5A841.quest_subtitle: "Ore no! It's Spelunkery!"
	quest.29707092A53D4AAF.quest_desc: ["Now that you have a pickaxe your next stop is &miron&r &6copper&r! Look for it around the entrance to caves."]
	quest.2A00EF3CA92BE209.quest_desc: [
		"To get started with Create (and subsequently get your Iron Pickaxe) you're going to need &l&7Andesite Alloy&r&r, and a whole lot more the further you go."
		""
		"Start by collecting some &7&lAndesite&r&r and either Zinc or Iron nuggets."
	]
	quest.2A00EF3CA92BE209.quest_subtitle: "The key to Create"
	quest.2AAA8436F604C8F6.quest_desc: ["Ahhh.. finally, having access to mining stone and iron. Sadly coal is still out of reach, but we're taking baby steps here."]
	quest.2AAE061C954D7E04.quest_desc: ["Placing a handle on a contraption lets you pull and move your contraption around!"]
	quest.2E2D6D1F41D7BA21.quest_desc: [
		"Something might look a little different if you haven't played a lot of modpacks, that's thanks to YUNG!"
		""
		"Take some time to look around and explore the redesigned fortress. While you're at it you may as well stuff your pockets (and backpack) with all the treausers inside!"
	]
	quest.357C17BFAF372EB5.quest_desc: [
		"Smelt up your Raw Iron and craft your first &lIron Pickaxe!&r"
		""
		"All other Iron tools will be made similarly, Remember to use JEI!"
		"Some tools require Iron Sheets, with the mechanical press you could use a depot or a solid block replacing the basin to create them."
	]
	quest.357C17BFAF372EB5.quest_subtitle: "Yes, this can actually mine stone."
	quest.357C17BFAF372EB5.title: "Now Thats A Pick!"
	quest.39307676CADEBE59.quest_desc: [
		"Your first source of &bRotational Power&r to begin your journey into &6Create!&r This power source will make you hungry quickly and requires you to constantly crank it to keep your machines going."
		""
		"Don't worry though, soon we'll &mexploit&r enlist an animal or two to help out!"
	]
	quest.39307676CADEBE59.quest_subtitle: "You powered machinary!"
	quest.39307676CADEBE59.title: "Hand Crank"
	quest.3AB2F38FBA28F641.quest_subtitle: "Have some water, it's hot down here."
	quest.3C93AD1A6F98B62B.quest_desc: [
		"Arguably the most neccesary component to &zAeronautics&r: The &3Contraption Diagram&r!"
		""
		"Place this onto your contraption and right click it, you can see the effect of mass, gravity, and even watch your center of mass."
	]
	quest.3DC3C055D3CAC041.quest_subtitle: "MAYBE MOVE TO CREATE CHAPTER?"
	quest.4C42BD1E264F5365.quest_desc: ["Now that you have your sticks and stones, craft 1 of each into a &lhatchet&r. Use this to cut down your first trees."]
	quest.4E928F73B2BDB3E6.title: "Take To The Sky"
	quest.54FB4C5B0F2890BA.quest_desc: ["To get your first &6Copper Ingots&r place your Raw Copper onto the campfire."]
	quest.54FB4C5B0F2890BA.title: "3x Copper Ingots"
	quest.553B12306F604327.quest_desc: [
		"To work with iron, its gotta be &4heated&r! "
		"Slap a Basic Burner under your Basin, throw in some charcoal, light it, and you'll be able to craft some iron tool heads!"
		""
		""
		"{image:nonamepack:textures/quests/low_heated_compactor.png width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.553B12306F604327.quest_subtitle: "It's getting hot in here..."
	quest.553B12306F604327.title: "Heating"
	quest.5E2B89D9EB7C3C39.quest_subtitle: "It is called MineCRAFT after all"
	quest.6791E24A9CFA844A.quest_desc: [
		"While you're exploring the fortress you'll likely enounter a few Wither Skeletons that are trying to &mkill you&r give you hugs. Be sure to &mcollect their skulls&r hug them back!"
		""
		"Once you have 3 of them, if you feel prepared, you can take on the Wither!"
	]
	quest.6791E24A9CFA844A.title: "Spooky Scary Skeletons"
	quest.6CF4337005785644.quest_desc: ["Don't go trying to punch trees with your fist just yet. To get started you need to collect &7&lrocks&r&r from the ground and break some leaves to get sticks."]
	quest.6CF4337005785644.quest_subtitle: "These may break your bones..."
	quest.6CF4337005785644.title: "Sticks \\& Stones"
	quest.707A04EA9F99F727.quest_desc: [
		"By placing a &#994D1BPhysics Assembler&r on a block and flipping the lever you get a simulated physics block, which roll tumble and fall."
		""
		"You can then build onto that block to build a contraption or you can just build you contraption, glue it together, and then place a &#994D1BPhysics Assembler&r onto the contraption to activate its simulated physics."
	]
	quest.707A04EA9F99F727.quest_subtitle: "Lets Get Physical"
	quest.707A04EA9F99F727.title: "Your First Contraption"
	quest.7B51DA14155497B4.quest_desc: ["Now that you have a &6Copper Pickaxe&r, it's finally time to go collect some Raw Iron. Don't rush to crafting an Iron Pickaxe though. First, you have to dip into Create."]
	quest.7B51DA14155497B4.quest_subtitle: "Don't let it rust though"
	quest.7B51DA14155497B4.title: "Time for iron!"
